# Secrets / state — never track
**/github-copilot/
**/uv/uv-receipt.json
**/.claude/settings.local.json

# Claude Code state. The claude package is stowed with --no-folding, so this state normally
# lives in a real ~/.claude outside the repo and none of these paths exist here. Kept as a
# backstop: a plain `stow claude` would re-fold ~/.claude into this tree, and session
# transcripts must never reach a public repo.
claude/.claude/.last-*
claude/.claude/backups/
claude/.claude/cache/
claude/.claude/file-history/
claude/.claude/history.jsonl
claude/.claude/projects/
claude/.claude/session-env/
claude/.claude/sessions/
claude/.claude/shell-snapshots/
claude/.claude/statsig/
claude/.claude/todos/

# Work-machine skills and commands: employer-internal project keys, hostnames, URLs.
claude/.claude/skills/jira-ticket/
claude/.claude/commands/jira-learn.md
